{
  "version": "0.4",
  "title": "SastraPro Clean Article - PageSpeed Ultra Starter",
  "type": "container",
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "sastra_article_root",
      "elType": "container",
      "isInner": false,
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "boxed",
        "boxed_width": {
          "unit": "px",
          "size": 800
        },
        "flex_direction": "column",
        "flex_align_items": "stretch",
        "gap": {
          "unit": "px",
          "size": 24
        },
        "padding": {
          "unit": "px",
          "top": "36",
          "right": "16",
          "bottom": "48",
          "left": "16",
          "isLinked": false
        },
        "background_background": "classic",
        "background_color": "#ffffff"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "article_meta_tag",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "TUTORIAL & PANDUAN LENGKAP",
            "header_size": "span",
            "typography_typography": "custom",
            "typography_font_size": {
              "unit": "px",
              "size": 13
            },
            "typography_font_weight": "700",
            "typography_letter_spacing": {
              "unit": "px",
              "size": 1.2
            },
            "title_color": "#2563eb"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "article_headline_h1",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Judul Artikel Lengkap: Panduan Praktis Meraih Skor 100 di Google PageSpeed Mobile",
            "header_size": "h1",
            "typography_typography": "custom",
            "typography_font_size": {
              "unit": "px",
              "size": 34
            },
            "typography_font_weight": "800",
            "typography_line_height": {
              "unit": "em",
              "size": 1.25
            },
            "title_color": "#0f172a"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "article_byline_meta",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">Ditulis oleh <strong>Redaksi</strong> &bull; Terakhir diperbarui 25 November 2026</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "article_featured_image",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": {
              "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499750310107-5fef28a66643?w=1200&h=675&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
              "id": ""
            },
            "image_size": "full",
            "aspect_ratio": "16/9",
            "width": {
              "unit": "%",
              "size": 100
            },
            "image_border_border": "solid",
            "image_border_width": {
              "unit": "px",
              "top": "1",
              "right": "1",
              "bottom": "1",
              "left": "1",
              "isLinked": true
            },
            "image_border_color": "#e2e8f0",
            "image_border_radius": {
              "unit": "px",
              "top": "12",
              "right": "12",
              "bottom": "12",
              "left": "12",
              "isLinked": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "article_body_content",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: #334155;\">Halaman ini dirancang menggunakan arsitektur Flexbox Container tunggal yang sangat ringan. Tidak ada pembungkus div berlebih (div-soup), dan seluruh gambar diatur menggunakan rasio aspek 16:9 bawaan browser sehingga menjamin <strong>Zero Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)</strong>.</p><h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Mengapa Performa Mobile Begitu Krusial?</h2><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: #334155;\">Algoritma Google secara ketat memprioritaskan situs yang memiliki waktu respon singkat. Dengan menghilangkan efek animasi JavaScript berat dan menyuntikkan Critical CSS di area above-the-fold, situs kamu bisa terbuka instan di bawah 1 detik bahkan pada jaringan 4G standar.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
